Package: rankdiff
Title: Permanent-Transitory Rank Diffusion Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Matt Hindman", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "hindman@gwu.edu"),
    person("Philip Waggoner", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Fits a permanent-transitory rank diffusion model to panel data
    of ranked entities. Estimates rank-dependent parameters (volatility,
    persistence, mean reversion, heavy tails) from empirical moments, runs
    Monte Carlo simulations, and validates via 15 diagnostic tests. Includes
    ablation study and sensitivity analysis tools.
